  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p></div><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D26%26fileid%3D7%26regdt%3D20180619120426&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile280.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99D1F7475B2870B52B8E8B')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 가상의 외계생명체 분류(2학년).hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D26%26fileid%3D13%26regdt%3D20180619120426&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile270.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99A526455B287126229B39')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 파미산 코팅용.hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D26%26fileid%3D15%26regdt%3D20180619120426&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile242.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F997390505B2899A619C2D3')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 새로운 파미산의 열쇠.hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D26%26fileid%3D14%26regdt%3D20180619120426&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile251.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F9988AA455B287144245B7F')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 외계생명체 코팅용.hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/995535505B28721035\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20180616_100557.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"768\"  id=\"A_995535505B287210359482\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99FBBB4F5B28723A01\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20180616_102753.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"768\"  id=\"A_99FBBB4F5B28723A0103E6\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992AC4505B2872122A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20180616_100355.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"768\"  id=\"A_992AC4505B2872122AE979\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9911DE505B2872132B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20180616_095546.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_9911DE505B2872132B7E8A\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99284B505B28721538\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20180616_101544.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_99284B505B287215387C42\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992724505B2872162B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20180616_101724.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_992724505B2872162BEE5A\"/></p><p>1학년 수업 준비하면서</p><p>분류 단원이 빠져있던 2학년 영재학급 학생들과 미리 해보았습니다.</p><p>분류할 때 비슷한 특징을 가진 외계생명체들을 모으고 나누기 쉽도록 코팅해서 한 세트씩 나누어 주었습니다. ^^<br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
